// A22 The Infernal Gate Opens: the Court of Mammon (the owner's design, 2026-11-08; the Armageddon
// card is code: crates/ffh-core/src/deck/doom_cards.rs, its rules crates/ffh-core/src/ffh/cards/new_civs_2.rs).
