  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_INFERNAL_GATE": "The Infernal Gate Opens",
    "TXT_KEY_DOOM_INFERNAL_GATE_HELP": "A new civilization, the Court of Mammon (evil), arrives beside the civilization with the most gold, on the best free site within 4 plots of its borders: Aurivane (its hero), two Champions, two Longbowmen, two Settlers, a Worker, two Manes and 200 gold. It knows the techs half the civilizations know.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Avaricious: +100% gold; buys units at 2 gold per hammer left, under any civic.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Buy Out: each of its land units may take an adjacent unit of a civilization it is at war with for 3 times its production cost in gold (not heroes or world units).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Fallow: its cities produce no food and start at size 3; Manes join them as population.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The Manes of the evil dead go to the Court or to the Infernals: to the one in play, to one of the two at random while both are.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]-4 attitude between the Court and the Infernals.[NEWLINE]Played only with a free site and a free player slot.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_AURIVANE": "Aurivane",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_AURIVANE_PEDIA": "Aurivane keeps Mammon's ledger. Every soul in it has a price, and he has paid most of them.",
    "TXT_KEY_UNIT_AURIVANE_STRATEGY": "A demon hero with attack 70 and defence 60.",
    "TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_MAMMONS_COIN": "Mammon's Coin",
    "TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_MAMMONS_COIN_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Buy Out (while the Court of Mammon owns the unit): an adjacent unit of a civilization you are at war with joins you, for 3 times its production cost in gold. Not heroes or world units.",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_PALACE_COURT_OF_MAMMON": "Palace",
    "TXT_KEY_TRAIT_AVARICIOUS": "Avaricious",
    "TXT_KEY_TRAIT_AVARICIOUS_SHORT": "Avaricious",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_COURT_OF_MAMMON_DESC": "The Court of Mammon",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_COURT_OF_MAMMON_SHORT_DESC": "Court of Mammon",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_COURT_OF_MAMMON_ADJECTIVE": "Mammonite",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_COURT_OF_MAMMON_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Buy Out: each of its land units may take an adjacent unit of a civilization it is at war with for 3 times its production cost in gold (not heroes or world units).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Its cities start at size 3 and grow only by Manes: the Manes of the evil dead go to it or to the Infernals (one of the two at random while both are in play).[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Its cities have Demonic Citizens: their population causes no unhappiness or unhealthiness.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]-4 attitude between it and the Infernals.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Hero: Aurivane.",
    "TXT_KEY_CIV_COURT_OF_MAMMON_PEDIA": "The Court of Mammon is hell's counting house. Its demons come through the gate with chests of gold, to buy the world rather than burn it.",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_1": "Gildmaw",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_2": "The Counting House",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_3": "Tithegate",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_4": "Brassvault",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_5": "Usurer's Rest",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_6": "Goldrot",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_7": "Ledgerdeep",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_8": "Avarice",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_9": "Debtor's Pit",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_10": "Mintfire",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_11": "Pawnmarch",
    "TXT_KEY_CITY_COURT_OF_MAMMON_12": "The Last Coffer",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_AURIVANE": "Aurivane",
    "TXT_KEY_LEADER_AURIVANE_PEDIA": "Aurivane, the Gilded Prince, is Mammon's steward on the mortal side of the gate. He does not burn what he can buy."
  }
